<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR is stable at 10.39 pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR is stable at 10.39 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month was unchanged at 10.39 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) was steady at 9.90 percent.</p>
